    '**Why a percentage would leave the committee worse off.** The only evidence available is that the co-operative\'s engineer recommended work in March 2024 and that the work has been deferred twice. **A figure derived from that is the same paragraph with a number attached. The first member to ask how I derived it would be told that I did not — and the four figures above, which are exact, would be read as equally soft.** That is the specific damage I am avoiding, and it is not a general objection to estimating.',
    '**Why I will not give a range either.** I was asked for 20 to 40 per cent. **I can support neither end. A range invented at both ends is not an expression of uncertainty; it is two unsupported numbers where there was one, and it reads as precision about the width of my ignorance.**',
